# Owner: control composition; canonical absolute protected JSON file reference (string).
# Optional omission disables M26. Nonempty readable0600 file under owned0700 parent;
# no inline secret. Explicit serve --env-file overrides YAML middleware_config_file;
# ambient environment is ignored. Mounted path must exist; restart required.
PROJECT_ONE_MIDDLEWARE_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/middleware/configuration.json
# Owner: middleware policy; optional canonical absolute protected env-file reference (string).
# Omit this entire key for default/JSON policy. Nonempty readable0600 file under
# owned0700 parent, distinct from configuration. No inline secret. Explicit serve
# --env-file overrides YAML middleware_environment_file; middleware.LoadFiles then
# applies its declared policy keys over JSON. Unknown/false/invalid values refuse;
# never reads ambient keys. Mounted path must exist; restart required.
PROJECT_ONE_MIDDLEWARE_ENVIRONMENT_FILE=/run/projectone/middleware/policy.env
